{"unit_id":"alchaincyf__huashu-design#card-zh","repo":"alchaincyf/huashu-design","commit":"b2460b031c33ff32d2bf3b97263527daa231e4de","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"huashu-design 是面向编码 agent 的设计 skill，通过 DSH 文件系统 skill provider 加载 SKILL.md 和配套素材。它支持用 HTML 制作网页与 App 原型、演示文稿、动画、信息图和小红书图文，并提供渲染检查、设计 lint、经验记录及 PPTX/PDF 等导出流程。适合希望在终端对话中完成视觉设计和交付物制作的用户。基础设计流程本地运行；AI 视频评审和豆包语音合成等云端能力为可选项，分别使用 ARK_API_KEY 或 DOUBAO TTS 配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:3-8","scripts/xhs_render.py:1","scripts/export_deck_pptx.mjs:1","scripts/export_deck_pdf.mjs:1","scripts/cloud/ai-review-video.py:78-89","scripts/cloud/tts-doubao.mjs:23-29"]}
{"unit_id":"alchaincyf__huashu-design#card-en","repo":"alchaincyf/huashu-design","commit":"b2460b031c33ff32d2bf3b97263527daa231e4de","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"huashu-design is a design skill for coding agents, loaded through DSH’s filesystem skill provider and its bundled SKILL.md. It supports HTML web and app prototypes, presentations, animation, infographics, and social carousels, with rendering checks, design linting, local experience records, and PPTX/PDF export workflows. It suits users who want to create visual deliverables through an agent conversation in their coding environment. Core design work is local; cloud video review and Doubao text-to-speech are optional and use their respective API configuration.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:3-8","scripts/xhs_render.py:1","scripts/export_deck_pptx.mjs:1","scripts/export_deck_pdf.mjs:1","scripts/cloud/ai-review-video.py:78-89","scripts/cloud/tts-doubao.mjs:23-29"]}
